tps://api.github.com/users/citadelculture/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Implements owner decision **D336 (option a)**. This PR is repurposed from D314, which landed in #1692: the TypeScript SDK job now also runs when a PR changes the root **`package.json`**, **`pnpm-workspace.yaml`** or **`.npmrc`**.\n\n- `.github/workflows/sdk.yml`: main is merged in, and main's `case` form of \"Detect changed paths\" is kept, with one added arm: `package.json | pnpm-workspace.yaml | .npmrc`. These patterns match root paths only, so nested look-alikes don't count. The workflow comment now mentions D336.\n- `.github/scripts/test_sdk_path_filter.py` (new on main): extracts the step's own script and runs it in bash against real git diffs. `repo-checks` picks it up. 26 cases:\n\n| case | runs |\n|---|---|\n| root `package.json` / `pnpm-workspace.yaml` / `.npmrc`, each alone and with an unrelated file | yes |\n| `sdk/typescript/package.json` (through `sdk/typescript/*`) | yes |\n| D314 lockfiles, `sdk/typescript/**`, `codex-rs/exec/**`, `sdk.yml` (main's existing triggers) | yes |\n| `sdk/python/package.json`, `.devcontainer/codex-install/package.json`, `sdk/python/.npmrc`, `package.json.bak` | no |\n| other lockfiles (devcontainer, lint tool), docs, other Rust, Python SDK, other workflows | no |\n\n**Red/green:** against main's `sdk.yml` (`ca204cfefe`), the extended test fails exactly the 6 new \"runs\" cases. With this PR, all 26 pass.\n**Not run locally:** the rest of `.github/scripts`, which has macOS-only failures that are identical on main. CI runs it.\n\nBase `ca204cfefe11ea25e2c8d9973ba6779687a9c686`, head `e9a0cf6ca714c84f1ce4f1ecec95795843573d6a`, DCO signed off.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-07T15:03:49Z","updated_at":"2026-11-07T19:36:32Z","closed_at":"2026-11-07T19:36:16Z","merged_at":"2026-11-07T19:36:16Z